  <h1>In the Jungle DLC Guide</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    In the Jungle is the paid expansion that adds the Jungle, Sato and Marinca Bloom.
  </p>

  <h2>How to start</h2>
  <p>
    The Jungle content becomes available through the expansion content. Sato arrives in the Jungle
    and introduces <strong>Marinca Bloom</strong>, a new app on Dave's smartphone that tracks jungle
    fish cards.
  </p>

  <h2>Marinca Bloom flower</h2>
  <p>
    The flower has three resources:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Sunlight: earned by walking when not diving.</li>
    <li>Water: earned by diving.</li>
    <li>Marinca progress: the number of cards collected.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The flower can wither if its health gets too low. Recover it by applying sunlight or water, then
    keep collecting cards to reach the final flower level.
  </p>

  <h2>Collection priority</h2>
  <p>
    Complete the base Blue Hole cards before focusing on the Jungle, because Marinca progress counts
    toward the flower. Use the <a href="/fish/">Fish Database</a> to check zones and active times
    while collecting.
  </p>

